sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Producer as Delivery / Order Service
    participant Broker as RabbitMQ (swiftdrop.events.exchange)
    participant Consumer as NotificationEventConsumer
    participant DB as Postgres (swiftdrop_notify)
    participant IAM as auth-iam-service (:8081)
    participant Dispatcher as MultiChannelNotificationDispatcher
    participant UI as React Frontend (Member 9)

    Note over Producer, Broker: Domain Event Published (Zero PII)
    Producer->>Broker: convertAndSend("swiftdrop.events.exchange", "parcel.status.changed.DELIVERED", event)
    Broker->>Consumer: delivery to notification.events.queue (AMQP message)

    Note over Consumer, DB: Stage 9: Idempotency & Deduplication
    Consumer->>DB: INSERT INTO processed_events (event_id, processed_at) VALUES (?, NOW())
    alt Duplicate Event (Primary Key Conflict)
        DB-->>Consumer: UniqueConstraintViolationException
        Consumer-->>Broker: ACK message (skip processing, log idempotency hit)
    else First Time Seen (Successful Insert)
        DB-->>Consumer: Row Inserted

        Note over Consumer: Observer Pattern: NotificationTrigger Evaluation
        Consumer->>Consumer: triggers.stream().filter(t -> t.matches(envelope))
        
        loop For Each Matching Trigger (e.g. DeliveredTrigger)
            Consumer->>Consumer: trigger.build(envelope) -> List<NotificationRequest>
            
            Note over Consumer, IAM: Stage 11: Contact Lookup (Cached)
            Consumer->>IAM: GET /internal/v1/users/{recipientId}/contact
            alt Cache Hit (10 min Caffeine Cache)
                Consumer->>Consumer: Return cached contact info
            else Cache Miss / Fallback
                IAM-->>Consumer: Return ContactInfo(phone, email, name)
            end

            Note over Consumer, DB: Stage 14: In-App Notification Persistence
            Consumer->>DB: INSERT INTO in_app_notifications (user_id, title, body, tracking_number, read)
            DB-->>Consumer: InAppNotification persisted

            Note over Consumer, Dispatcher: Stage 12 & 13: Template Sanitization & Dispatch
            Consumer->>Dispatcher: dispatch(NotificationRequest)
            Dispatcher->>Dispatcher: TemplateRendererService.render(template, params)
            Dispatcher->>Dispatcher: PiiMasker.maskPhone(phone), PiiMasker.maskEmail(email)
            
            alt User Preferences Check
                Dispatcher->>DB: SELECT * FROM recipient_preferences WHERE recipient_id = ?
                DB-->>Dispatcher: Preferences (emailEnabled=true, smsEnabled=true)
                Dispatcher->>Dispatcher: Send email via provider (mock or Azure Communication Services)
                Dispatcher->>DB: INSERT INTO notification_dispatch_logs (masked destination, SENT)
            else User Channel Suppressed
                Dispatcher->>DB: INSERT INTO notification_dispatch_logs (status: SUPPRESSED)
            end
        end

        Consumer-->>Broker: ACK message (Delivery completed)
    end

    Note over UI, Consumer: PR 5: Frontend In-App Updates
    loop Every 20 Seconds (Polling)
        UI->>Consumer: GET /api/v1/notifications/me/unread-count (Bearer JWT -> X-User-Id)
        Consumer-->>UI: { success: true, data: 1 } (Badge Counter Updates)
    end

    opt User Clicks Notification Bell
        UI->>Consumer: GET /api/v1/notifications/me
        Consumer-->>UI: Return In-App Notification List
        UI->>Consumer: PATCH /api/v1/notifications/me/{id}/read
        Consumer-->>UI: { success: true } (Unread count decrements to 0)
    end

